r-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["d5bd226a-d5ac-511a-968f-be677f0cb766" "f32f88d7-1c04-5ee9-8f63-bdecfc1ed874"] :answer-field/correct "d5bd226a-d5ac-511a-968f-be677f0cb766" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "9fe7d2e4-659c-5b6e-9c9b-6d0a9162b9e8" :question/id #uuid "9fe7d2e4-659c-5b6e-9c9b-6d0a9162b9e8" :question/problem "$$\nP=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -6 \\\\ 8 & -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,R=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -5 & -8 & -8 & -5\\end{bmatrix},\\,S=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $P,R,$ and $S?$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The product $RS$ is well defined\n- **II.** The product $PS$ is well defined\n- **III.** The product $PR$ is well defined" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $P$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix, $R$ is a $1\\times 5$ row vector, and $S$ is a $1\\times 2$ row vector. \n\nThere are $5$ columns in $R$ and $1$ row in $S.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $S,$ the matrices $R$ and $S$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{1\\times 5}{\\times }_{\\ne }{S}_{1\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $2$ columns in $P$ and $1$ row in $S.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $S,$ the matrices $P$ and $S$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{2\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{S}_{1\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $2$ columns in $P$ and $1$ row in $R.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $R,$ the matrices $P$ and $R$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{2\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{R}_{1\\times 5}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nWe conclude that all three statements are false." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["b19a20c5-afb7-5dc2-9fc1-9c594316a164" "c974abcf-7262-5f9f-bd6b-6da19ef7805f" "be555373-045c-506a-8a35-eea9aaaa8935"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "8b523942-a4cc-52af-ac57-78219e1b3443" :answer/id #uuid "8b523942-a4cc-52af-ac57-78219e1b3443" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "dc8f128a-f61f-5456-8848-2ff32e232e5e" :answer/id #uuid "dc8f128a-f61f-5456-8848-2ff32e232e5e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d17b4073-f034-57d1-9612-84b24201e0f5" :answer-field/id #uuid "d17b4073-f034-57d1-9612-84b24201e0f5" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["8b523942-a4cc-52af-ac57-78219e1b3443" "dc8f128a-f61f-5456-8848-2ff32e232e5e"] :answer-field/correct "8b523942-a4cc-52af-ac57-78219e1b3443" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "fab3f125-4732-5852-8a3b-74a036577c22" :answer/id #uuid "fab3f125-4732-5852-8a3b-74a036577c22" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "634eda15-ac4c-58ee-8987-5a03c7951b6f" :answer/id #uuid "634eda15-ac4c-58ee-8987-5a03c7951b6f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "002a391d-196d-5e6e-a5ad-c8c4da7a9101" :answer-field/id #uuid "002a391d-196d-5e6e-a5ad-c8c4da7a9101" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["fab3f125-4732-5852-8a3b-74a036577c22" "634eda15-ac4c-58ee-8987-5a03c7951b6f"] :answer-field/correct "fab3f125-4732-5852-8a3b-74a036577c22" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "bd7178d2-bc56-574e-b59d-1437513c672c" :answer/id #uuid "bd7178d2-bc56-574e-b59d-1437513c672c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "07fe8f3f-cc9a-59da-b696-08b8234d657b" :answer/id #uuid "07fe8f3f-cc9a-59da-b696-08b8234d657b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c81cfd27-3d9f-55aa-bdd4-33c537434f5d" :answer-field/id #uuid "c81cfd27-3d9f-55aa-bdd4-33c537434f5d" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["bd7178d2-bc56-574e-b59d-1437513c672c" "07fe8f3f-cc9a-59da-b696-08b8234d657b"] :answer-field/correct "bd7178d2-bc56-574e-b59d-1437513c672c" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "e01af3ae-fb4a-5e38-8b42-8320c8e0b105" :question/id #uuid "e01af3ae-fb4a-5e38-8b42-8320c8e0b105" :question/problem "$$\nP=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 9 \\\\ -7 & 6 \\\\ 3 & 7\\end{bmatrix},\\,R=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,S=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -6 & -9 & -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $P,R,$ and $S?$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The product $SP$ is well defined\n- **II.** The product $PS$ is well defined\n- **III.** The product $RS$ is well defined" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $P$ is a $3\\times 2$ matrix, $R$ is a $1\\times 2$ row vector, and $S$ is a $1\\times 5$ row vector. \n\nThere are $5$ columns in $S$ and $3$ rows in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $S$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $S$ and $P$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{S}_{1\\times 5}{\\times }_{\\ne }{P}_{3\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $2$ columns in $P$ and $1$ row in $S.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $S,$ the matrices $P$ and $S$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{3\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{S}_{1\\times 5}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $2$ columns in $R$ and $1$ row in $S.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $S,$ the matrices $R$ and $S$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{1\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{S}_{1\\times 5}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nWe conclude that all three statements are false." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["d17b4073-f034-57d1-9612-84b24201e0f5" "002a391d-196d-5e6e-a5ad-c8c4da7a9101" "c81cfd27-3d9f-55aa-bdd4-33c537434f5d"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "d8d70d25-2c3a-51bc-ba52-e7054852cfb5" :answer/id #uuid "d8d70d25-2c3a-51bc-ba52-e7054852cfb5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "f069bd38-0367-5fd7-9bc6-9d965655353a" :answer/id #uuid "f069bd38-0367-5fd7-9bc6-9d965655353a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9c7e2a8e-c431-5d07-a1c8-050d821fbc8f" :answer-field/id #uuid "9c7e2a8e-c431-5d07-a1c8-050d821fbc8f" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["d8d70d25-2c3a-51bc-ba52-e7054852cfb5" "f069bd38-0367-5fd7-9bc6-9d965655353a"] :answer-field/correct "f069bd38-0367-5fd7-9bc6-9d965655353a" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "2ef90c50-c0ed-5d96-9665-4922437d58f4" :answer/id #uuid "2ef90c50-c0ed-5d96-9665-4922437d58f4" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "bd996ffd-f797-5509-9bbe-b47b6aeefa46" :answer/id #uuid "bd996ffd-f797-5509-9bbe-b47b6aeefa46" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a3c54a46-9187-506d-a306-7298aa00b5a1" :answer-field/id #uuid "a3c54a46-9187-506d-a306-7298aa00b5a1" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["2ef90c50-c0ed-5d96-9665-4922437d58f4" "bd996ffd-f797-5509-9bbe-b47b6aeefa46"] :answer-field/correct "2ef90c50-c0ed-5d96-9665-4922437d58f4" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "e19500d1-8755-5dc6-ac50-746ede9424ca" :answer/id #uuid "e19500d1-8755-5dc6-ac50-746ede9424ca" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c6a813dd-19f7-54e1-a2c7-bd667d5aed30" :answer/id #uuid "c6a813dd-19f7-54e1-a2c7-bd667d5aed30" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "4d51da39-0b01-536b-bfb2-eec56fd78de6" :answer-field/id #uuid "4d51da39-0b01-536b-bfb2-eec56fd78de6" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["e19500d1-8755-5dc6-ac50-746ede9424ca" "c6a813dd-19f7-54e1-a2c7-bd667d5aed30"] :answer-field/correct "e19500d1-8755-5dc6-ac50-746ede9424ca" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "93240880-0a92-5ff3-9e93-67e683dcedec" :question/id #uuid "93240880-0a92-5ff3-9e93-67e683dcedec" :question/problem "$$\nO=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -5 & -8 & -8 \\\\ -5 & -2 & 8 & 5\\end{bmatrix},\\,P=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,R=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $O,P,$ and $R?$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The product $RP$ is well defined\n\n- **II.** The product $PR$ is well defined\n\n- **III.** The product $OP$ is well defined" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $O$ is a $2\\times 4$ matrix, $P$ is a $1\\times 2$ row vector, and $R$ is a $3\\times 1$ column vector.\n\nThere is $1$ column in $R$ and $1$ row in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ equals the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $R$ and $P$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{3\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\times }_{✓}{P}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 2}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $2$ columns in $P$ and $3$ rows in $R.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $R,$ the matrices $P$ and $R$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{1\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{R}_{3\\times 1}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $4$ columns in $O$ and $1$ row in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $O$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $O$ and $P$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{O}_{2\\times 4}{\\times }_{\\ne }{P}_{1\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nTherefore, statement I is true, while statements II and III are false." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["9c7e2a8e-c431-5d07-a1c8-050d821fbc8f" "a3c54a46-9187-506d-a306-7298aa00b5a1" "4d51da39-0b01-536b-bfb2-eec56fd78de6"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "2a4cd583-5b45-56dc-a6e1-195b989eb2a3" :answer/id #uuid "2a4cd583-5b45-56dc-a6e1-195b989eb2a3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "63547524-da22-5745-afb6-a330347919c4" :answer/id #uuid "63547524-da22-5745-afb6-a330347919c4" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "8307eb05-c0ad-51ff-8381-69c2aa369a62" :answer-field/id #uuid "8307eb05-c0ad-51ff-8381-69c2aa369a62" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["2a4cd583-5b45-56dc-a6e1-195b989eb2a3" "63547524-da22-5745-afb6-a330347919c4"] :answer-field/correct "2a4cd583-5b45-56dc-a6e1-195b989eb2a3" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "34e4c5ce-7e9c-5530-8b6b-ec090d2ebab0" :answer/id #uuid "34e4c5ce-7e9c-5530-8b6b-ec090d2ebab0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a87f780f-4b8f-5015-b434-03be4bcc01d7" :answer/id #uuid "a87f780f-4b8f-5015-b434-03be4bcc01d7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "45d02062-6090-52e6-a662-c6361863dc12" :answer-field/id #uuid "45d02062-6090-52e6-a662-c6361863dc12" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["34e4c5ce-7e9c-5530-8b6b-ec090d2ebab0" "a87f780f-4b8f-5015-b434-03be4bcc01d7"] :answer-field/correct "34e4c5ce-7e9c-5530-8b6b-ec090d2ebab0" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "34dafa4d-3944-582e-bbf7-64a2dcc62647" :answer/id #uuid "34dafa4d-3944-582e-bbf7-64a2dcc62647" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d55b794e-24e2-5354-bfec-ef76085b2a8c" :answer/id #uuid "d55b794e-24e2-5354-bfec-ef76085b2a8c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "3045f8ab-525f-5485-b581-68eae6f98ef3" :answer-field/id #uuid "3045f8ab-525f-5485-b581-68eae6f98ef3" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["34dafa4d-3944-582e-bbf7-64a2dcc62647" "d55b794e-24e2-5354-bfec-ef76085b2a8c"] :answer-field/correct "d55b794e-24e2-5354-bfec-ef76085b2a8c" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "795f6284-9977-53c9-b26a-515ee6438422" :question/id #uuid "795f6284-9977-53c9-b26a-515ee6438422" :question/problem "$$\nO=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -6 & -9 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -9 & 4 & 2 & 8 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 8 & 4 & -4 & -8 \\\\ -1 & 9 & -3 & -7 & 5\\end{bmatrix},\\,P=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & -5 & -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,R=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $O,P,$ and $R?$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The product $RO$ is well defined\n\n- **II.** The product $PR$ is well defined\n\n- **III.** The product $RP$ is well defined" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $O$ is a $4\\times 5$ matrix, $P$ is a $1\\times 4$ row vector, and $R$ is a $2\\times 1$ column vector.\n\nThere is $1$ column in $R$ and $4$ rows in $O.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $O,$ the matrices $R$ and $O$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{2\\times 1}{\\times }_{\\ne }{O}_{4\\times 5}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $4$ columns in $P$ and $2$ rows in $R.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $R,$ the matrices $P$ and $R$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{1\\times 4}{\\times }_{\\ne }{R}_{2\\times 1}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there is $1$ column in $R$ and $1$ row in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ equals the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $R$ and $P$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\times }_{✓}{P}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nTherefore, statement III is true, while statements I and II are false." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["8307eb05-c0ad-51ff-8381-69c2aa369a62" "45d02062-6090-52e6-a662-c6361863dc12" "3045f8ab-525f-5485-b581-68eae6f98ef3"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "32a9097c-5bc2-5cd1-9baa-bd8b990c97fd" :answer/id #uuid "32a9097c-5bc2-5cd1-9baa-bd8b990c97fd" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "02a6580c-0d89-558b-b971-11e565184416" :answer/id #uuid "02a6580c-0d89-558b-b971-11e565184416" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "131a6720-5179-5e6b-8f36-e30376510b3e" :answer-field/id #uuid "131a6720-5179-5e6b-8f36-e30376510b3e" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["32a9097c-5bc2-5cd1-9baa-bd8b990c97fd" "02a6580c-0d89-558b-b971-11e565184416"] :answer-field/correct "32a9097c-5bc2-5cd1-9baa-bd8b990c97fd" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "b095e79b-a819-586b-ab09-7239d584f9f2" :answer/id #uuid "b095e79b-a819-586b-ab09-7239d584f9f2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "783b131e-8f12-50a4-83d7-9f8aaca679d2" :answer/id #uuid "783b131e-8f12-50a4-83d7-9f8aaca679d2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5e7a67a5-a17a-53dc-81ea-712acf4793d9" :answer-field/id #uuid "5e7a67a5-a17a-53dc-81ea-712acf4793d9" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["b095e79b-a819-586b-ab09-7239d584f9f2" "783b131e-8f12-50a4-83d7-9f8aaca679d2"] :answer-field/correct "b095e79b-a819-586b-ab09-7239d584f9f2" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "58588f5a-9b68-55e3-be19-a5e5b6a4cf7f" :answer/id #uuid "58588f5a-9b68-55e3-be19-a5e5b6